1
00:01:50,879 --> 00:01:51,599
Director Guo, I'm here.

2
00:02:05,680 --> 00:02:06,439
Relax.

3
00:02:06,959 --> 00:02:08,400
No one will fine us here for sure.

4
00:02:14,639 --> 00:02:15,400
Today, Director Wei

5
00:02:15,719 --> 00:02:16,800
said before he left that

6
