7
00:02:20,159 --> 00:02:20,639
it shouldn't be an issue.

8
00:02:21,520 --> 00:02:22,319
That's great.

9
00:02:26,599 --> 00:02:26,960
Tan Yan,

10
00:02:28,400 --> 00:02:29,719
you need to think hard about this.

11
00:02:30,879 --> 00:02:33,199
Why didn't Bai Jiani

12
00:02:34,199 --> 00:02:36,439
