13
00:02:38,080 --> 00:02:39,560
I've thought about it, Director Guo.

14
00:02:40,319 --> 00:02:42,319
I probably didn't communicate well beforehand.

15
00:02:42,639 --> 00:02:44,080
But from Bai Jiani's behavior,

16
00:02:44,560 --> 00:02:46,520
you can see the entire SWAT detachment's

17
00:02:47,960 --> 00:02:49,520
