18
00:02:50,360 --> 00:02:51,479
They don't consider the big picture.

19
00:02:52,759 --> 00:02:53,280
It's not that serious.

20
00:02:54,199 --> 00:02:55,439
The leaders also said before they left

21
00:02:55,879 --> 00:02:56,960
that our memorial service

22
00:02:57,759 --> 00:02:59,400
was very sincere and successful.

23
00:03:00,400 --> 00:03:01,120
No empty platitudes.

24
00:03:02,319 --> 00:03:02,879
That's great.

25
00:03:05,680 --> 00:03:07,400
As for the personnel changes in your Publicity Department,

26
00:03:08,479 --> 00:03:09,520
