27
00:03:10,479 --> 00:03:11,280
It'll be announced tomorrow.

28
00:03:18,400 --> 00:03:19,960
This good news came so suddenly.

29
00:03:23,000 --> 00:03:23,439
What is it?

30
00:03:26,120 --> 00:03:27,879
I really feel like composing a poem right now.

31
00:03:34,719 --> 00:03:36,479
Eight years of following without pause.

32
00:03:39,599 --> 00:03:42,319
A wise mentor guides my future course.

33
00:03:45,159 --> 00:03:48,240
Setting sail today with a perfect wind.

34
00:03:49,919 --> 00:03:51,199
Spurring the horse,

35
00:03:53,879 --> 00:03:54,680
advancing once more.

36
00:03:55,800 --> 00:03:56,360
Advancing!

37
00:03:57,919 --> 00:03:58,680
Director Guo, rest assured.

38
00:04:01,080 --> 00:04:02,080
I will absolutely not let down

39
00:04:02,080 --> 00:04:04,120
your trust and expectations.

40
00:04:07,319 --> 00:04:07,759
It took the bait.

41
00:04:08,639 --> 00:04:09,199
It's hooked!

42
00:04:09,240 --> 00:04:09,599
Here it comes.

43
00:04:10,240 --> 00:04:10,800
It's hooked!

44
00:04:10,919 --> 00:04:11,479
It's hooked!

45
00:04:21,560 --> 00:04:22,279
Morning, Director Tan.

46
00:04:22,800 --> 00:04:23,360
Morning.

47
00:04:41,360 --> 00:04:42,079
Morning, Director Tan.

48
00:04:43,399 --> 00:04:43,680
Morning.

49
00:04:46,040 --> 00:04:46,319
This...

50
00:04:46,720 --> 00:04:48,079
This room

51
00:04:48,199 --> 00:04:49,240
