52
00:04:49,399 --> 00:04:51,560
How could Xiao Qu forget again?

53
00:04:53,519 --> 00:04:53,839
Here, here, here.

54
00:04:54,040 --> 00:04:54,759
Director Tan, here, let me do it.

55
00:04:55,959 --> 00:04:56,720
You can't reach it. Here.

56
00:04:57,639 --> 00:04:58,399
Thanks, Director Zhao.

57
00:04:59,040 --> 00:05:00,360
That tea you gave me...

58
00:05:01,279 --> 00:05:02,199
